# Packages tools/setup-android.sh disables (pm disable-user, reversible with pm enable).
# Android only drives the hardware here: kept are system_server's own pieces, Wi-Fi and
# network stack, telephony (system_server expects it), storage/permission providers,
# FusedLocation (without it LocationManagerService crashes system_server at boot),
# Settings (its FallbackHome stands in for the launcher), Shell, Magisk and Droidspaces.

